WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a squat, place the hands shoulder-width on the mat, fingers spread wide.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rise onto the balls of the feet and place the knees high on the upper arms.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lean forward, engaging the core, and lift one foot, then the other.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Round the upper back slightly and hug the heels toward the hips.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold briefly, then lower the feet with control back to a squat.
